Ez_fMa4SV8Q&oe=69A2D96F"}, "display_name": "Mega Fireball - Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["soccer", "brawl", "sports", "lava", "mixed"], "long_description": "Team up with your new best friend **Slappy** and transform your space into a chaotic sports arena. It's Mega Fireball!\n\n**\ud83d\udd25 Bring The Heat** \n\nControl Slappy to smash balls into the goal or punch them in yourself!\n{1734686903858372}\n\n\n**\ud83d\udcaa Challenge Mode** \n\nShow off your skills on the global leaderboard by competing in challenges featuring core gameplay + three unique themes: **Lava, Space, and Colors**\n{1696526707711118}\n\n\n**\ud83e\udd2f Remote Mixed-Reality Multiplayer** \n\nBattle 1v1 against friends from across the world using their real room\n{666286362941414}\n\n**\ud83e\udd1c\ud83e\udd1b 8 Player Local Multiplayer** \n\nBuddy up with 8 players in the same space\n{1879275782985876}", "short_description": "Mixed reality sports chaos in your living room"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.luckyjuicebox.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lucky Juicebox", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://luckyjuicebox.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "340976806431648